 . It brings these two artistic communities together with work from both yo
 uth and adults residing in both Arlington and Lexington as well as the Gre
 ater New England area.\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1-pP7XaG_XTi3wP3IO
 Tl2NBszXtLRFehD/view
