BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:bar-call-open-call-triennial-s-public-art-accelerator@boston-art-map
DTSTAMP:20261125T000106Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261207
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261208
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:Deadline: Open Call: Triennial's Public Art Accelerator
DESCRIPTION:The Triennial’s Public Art Accelerator returns with an open c
 all for three experienced Greater Boston–based artists to be part of Coh
 ort Ten of the Accelerator and the next Triennial in 2028. Workshops will 
 run from March 2027 through June 2027 and will culminate in the inclusion 
 of artist-driven proposals within the Triennial 2028 exhibition\, set to o
 pen May 2028.\nhttps://www.thetriennial.org/accelerator
URL:https://www.thetriennial.org/accelerator
CATEGORIES:Open call
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:bar-call-open-call-kin@boston-art-map
DTSTAMP:20261125T000106Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270113
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:Deadline: Open Call: KIN
DESCRIPTION:This national exhibition\, presented by Gallery 263 and juried 
 by Nadirah Mansour\, will examine the notion of kin beyond relationships o
 f blood\, culture\, region\, or circumstance. It asks what it means to bec
 ome kin with those beyond humanity\, how we understand them to be kin\, an
 d what our responsibilities toward kin who cannot speak or articulate need
 s is. Gallery 263 invites US-based artists of all experience levels to sub
 mit work that engages these questions and the material relationships they 
 are enmeshed in.\nhttps://gallery263.org/call/kin/?doing_wp_cron=179554038
 6.9282259941101074218750
URL:https://gallery263.org/call/kin/?doing_wp_cron=1795540386.9282259941101
 074218750
CATEGORIES:Open call
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
